lowReactive",4],{"content-page-subpath1:how-to-write-a-returns-policy":5,"page-header-video-undefined":29},{"uid":6,"document":7,"postSlices":319},"how-to-write-a-returns-policy",{"titleTag":8,"metaDescription":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":22,"slices":23},"How to Write a Returns Policy in 2025 | Guides for UK Businesses","Protect your business whilst aiding your customers with a comprehensive returns policy. Follow this complete guide to make the most of your returns policy","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-write-a-returns-policy",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":16,"slug":17,"first_publication_date":18,"last_publication_date":18,"uid":17,"link_type":19,"key":20,"isBroken":21},"ZL-1EREAACAAEkhR","subpath1",[15],"Guides","en-gb","guides","2023-07-25T12:59:36+0000","Document","a0eb4567-8ed5-4eef-812e-a891ff690c7a",false,{"link_type":19},[24,52,92,108,124,193,233,255],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":28,"id":50,"slice_type":51,"slice_label":29},"pageHeaderNoCta","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[],{"theme":29,"PageHeaderTitle":30,"PageHeaderText":31,"PageHeaderImage":37,"heroImage":48,"videoContent":49,"showPremiumLogo":29},null,"How to write a returns policy",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35,"direction":36},"paragraph","Follow along with this simple guide to learn how to write a clear and comprehensive returns policy for your business",[],"ltr",{"dimensions":38,"alt":41,"copyright":29,"url":42,"id":43,"edit":44},{"width":39,"height":40},300,45,"Business","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fa67ab394-df4f-431a-85c1-d7bec3a8d168_business.svg","YhYw-xIAAC0A0Qys",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$5bec4484-507e-4727-806d-9146fb94a4ed","page_header",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":54,"primary":84,"id":90,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":29},"multiContentCard",[55],{"CardImage":56,"CardTitle":29,"CardText":64},{"dimensions":57,"alt":60,"copyright":29,"url":61,"id":62,"edit":63},{"width":58,"height":59},1000,667,"Customer sat at a desk in their office using a laptop with multiple parcels packaged next to them. Their hand is positioned against their head to show concentration.","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8508.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},[65,68,72,75,78,81],{"type":33,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":36},"Follow along this guide to find out:",[],{"type":69,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":36},"list-item","Why you might need a returns policy for your website",[],{"type":69,"text":73,"spans":74,"direction":36},"Common pitfalls of the returns policy and how to avoid them",[],{"type":69,"text":76,"spans":77,"direction":36},"How to get started writing your returns policy",[],{"type":69,"text":79,"spans":80,"direction":36},"Where to place your returns policy on your website",[],{"type":69,"text":82,"spans":83,"direction":36},"How a returns policy can boost sales on your online store",[],{"CardSectionTitle":85,"CardSectionText":86},"Create a returns policy for your business and your customers",[87],{"type":33,"text":88,"spans":89,"direction":36},"Shifts in consumer habits over the years have led to returns not only being a consequence of customer unsatisfaction or regret, but also a consequence of routine online shopping practices. A customer might purchase a number of products, with the intention of returning one or more after they have trialled or compared them. Regardless, these occurrences are a natural part of running a business and must be accounted for. A well-structured returns policy can be an invaluable tool for not only saving your business headache with frustrated customers, but also building trust and clarity in your product offering as a guarantee.",[],"card$56028267-5b40-42eb-bafe-5cd392e29acc","card",{"variation":93,"version":26,"items":94,"primary":95,"id":107,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":29},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":96,"CardTitle":97,"CardText":98,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":105,"IsEco":21},"none","Why do you need a returns policy on your website?",[99,102],{"type":33,"text":100,"spans":101,"direction":36},"By law, a customer is entitled to a return or a refund on a product that is damaged or a product that doesn’t function as advertised. If it happens that your product would be ineligible for a refund or return in any other case, then it may be that a returns policy isn’t necessary for your website at all. While it can be beneficial for the sake of transparency to your customer to declare that you don’t accept refunds or returns, it is not a requirement that you make the legislation behind this clearly accessible on your platform.",[],{"type":33,"text":103,"spans":104,"direction":36},"If returns are on the table for your product, however, then an effective returns policy can provide your customers with quick access to all the information they need to initiate a return in a simple and easy-to-read format. Creating a returns policy also allows you to place conditions on a return. These conditions might be that it must be returned within a certain timeframe, or that items are only eligible for store credit. These are the primary purposes behind putting a returns policy in place. A good returns policy should be helpful and clear for your customer whilst also allowing you as a business to take control.",[],{"link_type":106},"Any","card$53148e54-2d30-479c-b8bb-d343b7aea0ce",{"variation":93,"version":26,"items":109,"primary":110,"id":123,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":29},[],{"CardAvatar":96,"CardTitle":111,"CardText":112,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":122,"IsEco":21},"Common pitfalls to avoid in your returns policy",[113,116,119],{"type":33,"text":114,"spans":115,"direction":36},"Don’t be overly formal. You’re not drafting a legal document; the law is already incredibly clear on the rights of shoppers. You’re making a policy that should be easy to understand and should be written in such a way that a customer can easily extract the information they need by scanning through. So, no legalese!",[],{"type":33,"text":117,"spans":118,"direction":36}," Don’t make it difficult to find. Preventing frustration is a key crux of the returns policy, so burying it deep within your sites infrastructure is the antithesis of what a good returns policy should stand for.",[],{"type":33,"text":120,"spans":121,"direction":36},"Don’t contradict yourself. You will notice clarity is a theme throughout this guide. If you have different policies for different products, clearly divide your page into sections so that no information appears to contradict itself. ",[],{"link_type":106},"card$d329cbdb-7ac6-4b8b-b817-bdd58fe855cd",{"variation":125,"version":26,"items":126,"primary":188,"id":191,"slice_type":192,"slice_label":29},"listComponent",[127,140,152,164,176],{"title":128,"content":129,"icon":133},"Return, exchange, or final sale",[130],{"type":33,"text":131,"spans":132,"direction":36},"This should be an itemised or categorised list of all of your products and whether they are eligible for a full or partial refund, some form of credit or exchange, or final sale, no refunds.",[],{"dimensions":134,"alt":136,"copyright":29,"url":137,"id":138,"edit":139},{"width":135,"height":135},40,"Help icon","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F77f34345-2ded-4116-bbc6-819ed2588756_help+1.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zsw",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},{"title":141,"content":142,"icon":146},"Deadline for return",[143],{"type":33,"text":144,"spans":145,"direction":36},"It is standard practice to include a deadline for returns to protect your business. Look out for competitors and their return times, because todays savvy shoppers have certain expectations that it can be important to meet.",[],{"dimensions":147,"alt":148,"copyright":29,"url":149,"id":150,"edit":151},{"width":135,"height":135},"Icon of a clock","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},{"title":153,"content":154,"icon":158},"The condition of an item",[155],{"type":33,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":36},"While knowledge such as “keep the tags on clothes” and “item should remain in its box” is relatively well understood, it’s still important to cover. Be clear in your expectations of a returned product and a majority of customers will respect that.",[],{"dimensions":159,"alt":160,"copyright":29,"url":161,"id":162,"edit":163},{"width":135,"height":135},"Clothes in a box icon","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F310e5f30-345e-45c1-a5cb-91a5eceee8ae_What%27s+in+the+box.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsT",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},{"title":165,"content":166,"icon":170},"Cash or credit",[167],{"type":33,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":36},"In certain industries it is common for store credit to be offered ahead of a cash refund, with some companies even increasing the value of your return if you go for store credit. Regardless, detail how your credit system works and how\u002Fwhere you can spend It.",[],{"dimensions":171,"alt":172,"copyright":29,"url":173,"id":174,"edit":175},{"width":135,"height":135},"Money icon","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},{"title":177,"content":178,"icon":182},"How to get started",[179],{"type":33,"text":180,"spans":181,"direction":36},"One of the most important parts of a returns policy - how to actually make a return. You should include all of the channels that a customer can go through to process a refund, whether that is email, phone, portal, chatbot or even in-store.",[],{"dimensions":183,"alt":184,"copyright":29,"url":185,"id":186,"edit":187},{"width":135,"height":135},"Phone icon","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},{"theme":29,"title":189,"description":190},"Writing your returns policy","The first thing to consider is your brand tone-of-voice. Your returns policy should sound like an organic piece of content written by a person, so that a customer can interact with it more naturally. Start by introducing an overview of your headline proposition when it comes to returns\u002Frefunds. Without getting into too much detail, let your customer know where you stand with returns. Your returns policy should then be broken down into the following segments:","list_block$16824d41-8d02-4f9a-b1eb-28359ad83318","list_block",{"variation":194,"version":26,"items":195,"primary":229,"id":232,"slice_type":192,"slice_label":29},"default-slice",[196,205,213,221],{"title":197,"content":198,"isNumbered":202,"icon":203,"image":204},"Place it in a banner on your product pages",[199],{"type":33,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":36},"Sometimes your returns policy can boost your product offering, and in these cases, it can be advisable to treat it almost like an advert alongside your product.",[],true,{},{},{"title":206,"content":207,"isNumbered":202,"icon":211,"image":212},"Add a call to action in the customer receipt",[208],{"type":33,"text":209,"spans":210,"direction":36},"In the event of dissatisfaction, a text or email receipt is likely the first place a customer might look. Making your returns policy clear and easily accessible at this stage could save considerable frustration and recover you some repeat business.",[],{},{},{"title":214,"content":215,"isNumbered":202,"icon":219,"image":220},"Repeat it in your shopping cart and checkout stages",[216],{"type":33,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":36},"At this stage of purchase, cart abandonment is always a major risk. So, while second thoughts might be rearing their head, you could potentially save a sale by reassuring your customer of your comprehensive returns policy.",[],{},{},{"title":222,"content":223,"isNumbered":202,"icon":227,"image":228},"Create a Frequently Asked Questions",[224],{"type":33,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":36},"“Help me!” your customer cries out as they frantically Google their issue. Having a frequently asked question covering your returns policy will be the solution that swoops in during your customers time of need.",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":230,"description":231,"showPaddingTop":21},"Placing your returns policy on your website","You’ve put the work in making the contents of your returns policy clear for your customers, now you need to make it easy to find. Thankfully, online shoppers are becoming more and more savvy to typical website structure, so it may well be that simply placing it in the footer of your website will suffice. Here are a few other ideas to make sure that your shoppers encounter it at the right time in their purchase journey:","list_block$a89ed1f2-6678-44c3-82b0-25f64246534c",{"variation":93,"version":26,"items":234,"primary":235,"id":254,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":29},[],{"CardAvatar":96,"CardTitle":236,"CardText":237,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":253,"IsEco":21},"Utilising your returns policy for marketing and sales",[238,241,244,247,250],{"type":33,"text":239,"spans":240,"direction":36},"At the start we mentioned a modern-day online shopping habit known as bracketing, where customers purchase multiple products with the intention of returning at least one as a way of trailing different styles or sizes. This practice has become incredibly prevalent over the years as a way of enjoying some of the benefits of high-street shopping without having to leave home.",[],{"type":33,"text":242,"spans":243,"direction":36},"While this may sound frustrating, it actually opens up a unique opportunity to leverage your returns policy as a marketing tool to boost sales. As far as we can tell, bracketing isn’t going anywhere, so by embracing your flexible returns policy and possibly even competing with other companies in your space, you can boost your product offering.",[],{"type":33,"text":245,"spans":246,"direction":36},"Advertise the benefits of your returns policy in your marketing materials and on your product pages, and you could not only see an increase in conversions, but also increased retention as a result of customer satisfaction. The purpose of bracketing is to achieve a positive shopping experience, so by facilitating that, you vastly increase the likelihood that a customer will come back for more. That’s not even to mention the potential for positive reviews, word of mouth and social media influence.",[],{"type":33,"text":248,"spans":249,"direction":36},"If you’re in a market where cart abandonment is a major risk for your conversion, then a clearly marked and confident returns policy or statement could make the difference.",[],{"type":33,"text":251,"spans":252,"direction":36},"Just be sure to factor in the refunds into your financing when you implement this strategy. It can be easy to get overexcited with the immediate increase in order sizes but remember some of that could come back in the form of a refund. Study your customers behaviour and make the necessary adjustments to targets and budget.",[],{"link_type":106},"card$88d18adb-b3fb-43ef-886e-3d9bbc4f1cdc",{"variation":194,"version":26,"items":256,"primary":257,"id":318,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":29},[],{"CardImage":258,"CardAvatar":96,"CardTitle":265,"CardText":266,"ButtonText":307,"ButtonUrl":308,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":259,"alt":260,"copyright":29,"url":261,"id":262,"edit":263},{"width":58,"height":59},"A side profile view of a business owner sitting at a desk in their office using their laptop and smiling. Stacked parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","how-to-write-a-returns-policy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":264,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},2,"Partner with Evri for send and return solutions for your business",[267,270,273,276,279],{"type":33,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":36},"Are you sending more than 150 parcels a week? If yes, then you could be eligible for one of our incredible business accounts that are helping enterprises of all sizes save time and money as they grow. Check out just a few of the benefits you’d receive when you open a business account with Evri:",[],{"type":69,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":36},"Discounted prices on parcel deliveries",[],{"type":69,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":36},"Regular van pick ups from your home or office",[],{"type":69,"text":277,"spans":278,"direction":36},"Enhanced customer support with a dedicated line",[],{"type":33,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":36},"If you’re still building your empire and don’t quite meet our threshold, then don’t fear. Our prices are affordable for all senders, and with our bulk integration tool, we can make delivering multiple parcels cheap and easy for your business. Send a parcel today with Evri.",[282,296,298,305],{"start":283,"end":284,"type":285,"data":286},146,167,"hyperlink",{"id":287,"type":288,"tags":289,"lang":16,"slug":291,"first_publication_date":292,"last_publication_date":293,"uid":294,"url":295,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"ZbkHRRIAACAAOKkF","content-page",[290],"Our Services","how-to-link-your-accounts","2024-01-30T14:28:16+0000","2026-07-06T15:22:51+0000","bulk-send","\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send",{"start":283,"end":284,"type":297},"strong",{"start":299,"end":300,"type":285,"data":301},243,272,{"link_type":30